      "latex": "\\mathcal{L}(\\bphi;\\bX)\n&= \\int \\qPhi(\\bT) \\left( \\log \\pT(\\bX) + \\log \\pA(\\bT) - \\log \\qPhi(\\bT) \\right) \\,d\\bT \\\\\n&= \\int p(\\bzeta) \\left( \\log \\pT(\\bX) + \\log \\pA(\\bT) - \\log \\qPhi(\\bT) \\right) \\bigg|_{\\bT=\\hPhi(\\bzeta)} \\,d\\bzeta\n\\eqnr",
